# used to verify np=4 multi-rank correctness on a system with more cells (64, 4x4x4) than
# MPI ranks and a safe grid_dim=4 per axis (avoids the grid_dim=2 periodic-ghost edge case).
# 151 rows (1+3*48+6), 480 cols (240 per type) + 1 trailing label col = 481.

